 ng of Equality: How the Second World War Shaped the Norwegian Income Distr
 ibution\n• Sari Pekkala Kerr — Gender Differences in Experiments and N
 atural Experiments\n\n16:00–16:30 Coffee\n\n16:30–17:30\n• Matti Sar
 vimäki — Finding One’s Path: Career-Counselor Training and Students
 ’ Educational Choices\n• Hanna Virtanen — Education\, Gender\, and F
 amily Formation\n• Tuomo Virkola — College Admissions Criteria\, Stude
 nts' Academic Performance and Social Mobility\n\n19:00 Dinner Restaurant 3
 05\n\nFull programme: https://aalto-econ.fi/esimerkki/tuomas-pekkarinen-me
 morial-workshop.html\nEvent page: https://www.helsinkigse.fi/events/tuomas
